# Base URL of the VibeVoice .NET API (no trailing slash).
# Leave unset in development: Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:5080 (override with VITE_API_PROXY),
# which also makes `npm run dev:lan` work from phones on the same Wi-Fi. Set it for production builds.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5080
